5. How to obtain authorization

   Requests for authorization go to: [LICENSING CONTACT EMAIL]

   An authorization is valid only if it is in writing and signed by every
   Copyright Owner: by default all four founders or, for a founder who has
   died, lacks capacity or has transferred their interest, the person
   lawfully entitled to act for them. No single founder can grant an
   authorization alone. Permission given verbally, by chat, by email alone or in a GitHub
   issue, pull request or comment is not an authorization. The standard form
   is docs/legal/PROJECT-USE-AUTHORIZATION.md. An authorization covers only
   the activities, purpose, duration and territory it states.

